{"chapters":[{"title":"The question","frames":[{"caption":"You climb a staircase of 5 steps, taking 1 or 2 steps at a time. In how many distinct ways can you reach the top?","grid":{"v":[["S","","","","","top"]],"cls":[["start","","","","","goal"]],"rowLabels":["step"],"colLabels":["0","1","2","3","4","5"]}},{"caption":"One way: steps of 1 + 1 + 2 + 1.","grid":{"v":[["S","","","","","top"]],"cls":[["start","path","path","","path","goal"]],"rowLabels":["step"],"colLabels":["0","1","2","3","4","5"]}},{"caption":"One way: steps of 2 + 2 + 1.","grid":{"v":[["S","","","","","top"]],"cls":[["start","","path","","path","goal"]],"rowLabels":["step"],"colLabels":["0","1","2","3","4","5"]}},{"caption":"Key observation: the <strong>last</strong> move onto step i came from step i&minus;1 (a 1-step) or step i&minus;2 (a 2-step). Those two groups never overlap, so add them.","grid":{"v":[["S","","","","","top"]],"cls":[["start","","","","","goal"]],"rowLabels":["step"],"colLabels":["0","1","2","3","4","5"]},"formula":"ways[i] = ways[i-1] + ways[i-2]"}]},{"title":"Plain recursion repeats work","frames":[{"caption":"Recursing on that observation directly: <code>ways(5) = ways(4) + ways(3)</code>, and so on down.","grid":{"v":[["","","","","",""]],"cls":[["empty","empty","empty","empty","empty","empty"]],"rowLabels":["calls"],"colLabels":["0","1","2","3","4","5"]}},{"caption":"Call <code>ways(5)</code>. Computed 1&times; so far.","grid":{"v":[["","","","","","1"]],"cls":[["empty","empty","empty","empty","empty","cur"]],"rowLabels":["calls"],"colLabels":["0","1","2","3","4","5"]},"formula":"calls so far: 1"},{"caption":"Call <code>ways(4)</code>. Computed 1&times; so far.","grid":{"v":[["","","","","1","1"]],"cls":[["empty","empty","empty","empty","cur","stack"]],"rowLabels":["calls"],"colLabels":["0","1","2","3","4","5"]},"formula":"calls so far: 2"},{"caption":"Call <code>ways(3)</code>. Computed 1&times; so far.","grid":{"v":[["","","","1","1","1"]],"cls":[["empty","empty","empty"